{"3317730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Highway Noir", "steam_appid": 3317730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello, agent. Well, former agent now...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were the best driver the Major Crimes Agency ever had - until one mission went bad and they hung you out to dry. Now you take the wheel in high-speed chases and white-knuckle getaways, running against the law on behalf of the highest bidder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every contract is a neon-soaked nightmare. Every mile is painted in shadow and rain. Until 'Merlin' calls, promising revenge...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpace the MCA. Take down the conspirators. Make the road your battleground. Go from the Agency's greatest asset to their downfall with Merlin's help... but can you place your trust in an enigma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel<br>Drive for your life on a road to revenge or ruination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way<br>Smash the conspiracy or simply ride through the night in Instaplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock out<br>Experience a completely original, pulse pounding score from a range of awesome composers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for accessibility<br>No game is perfect but Highway Noir is for as many people as possible with optional subtitles, tone tags, game speed adjustment and vision assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your revenge<br>Ride for the highest bidder, upgrade your fleet, settle the score with the Major Crimes Agency</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GameGrin:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.5/10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There’s nothing like speeding down the road at 400+ kph while dodging insanely packed roads, while also trying to not get caught&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/extras/4a6d3bea370b704aedded820a5822d00.avif?t=1776940940\" width=162 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This developer assures that no gen AI was used in this indie game. The use of any part of Highway Noir or related materials for training generative AI is NOT permitted</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hello, agent. Well, former agent now...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were the best driver the Major Crimes Agency ever had - until one mission went bad and they hung you out to dry. Now you take the wheel in high-speed chases and white-knuckle getaways, running against the law on behalf of the highest bidder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every contract is a neon-soaked nightmare. Every mile is painted in shadow and rain. Until 'Merlin' calls, promising revenge...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpace the MCA. Take down the conspirators. Make the road your battleground. Go from the Agency's greatest asset to their downfall with Merlin's help... but can you place your trust in an enigma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel<br>Drive for your life on a road to revenge or ruination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way<br>Smash the conspiracy or simply ride through the night in Instaplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock out<br>Experience a completely original, pulse pounding score from a range of awesome composers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for accessibility<br>No game is perfect but Highway Noir is for as many people as possible with optional subtitles, tone tags, game speed adjustment and vision assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your revenge<br>Ride for the highest bidder, upgrade your fleet, settle the score with the Major Crimes Agency</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GameGrin:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.5/10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There’s nothing like speeding down the road at 400+ kph while dodging insanely packed roads, while also trying to not get caught&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/extras/4a6d3bea370b704aedded820a5822d00.avif?t=1776940940\" width=162 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This developer assures that no gen AI was used in this indie game. The use of any part of Highway Noir or related materials for training generative AI is NOT permitted</p>", "short_description": "You are an underground driver for hire, fired from the Major Crimes Agency. Rush through a busy city at night as you take on high speed getaways, dangerous street races, white knuckle pursuits and more. Don't stop until you reveal the truth about who wanted you gone", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/bdac86ab5ea5c0af9d6d2e302ee7fa597dd9cd92/header.jpg?t=1776940940", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/29f0c05ba2d58fea02bc05fc2db7a839aaa00286/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776940940", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317730/29f0c05ba2d58fea02bc05fc2db7a839aaa00286/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776940940", "website": "https://archangelsoftworks.co.uk/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memor